        customers: ["**Families and value-conscious shoppers** across India, including smaller towns reached through franchise stores and dealers.", "**Premium casual buyers** of Hush Puppies, its fastest-growing group.", "**Franchisees and multi-brand retailers**, who buy on credit; debtor days rose from 8 to 19 as these channels grew."],
